{'symbol': 'J', 'date': '2021-09-01 11:28:00', 'title': 'JACOBS DELIVERS BROADLAND FLOOD ALLEVIATION PROJECT', 'text': 'DALLAS, SEPT. 1, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0 JACOBS (NYSE:J), TOGETHER WITH THE ENVIRONMENT AGENCY AND CONTRACTOR BAM NUTTALL , CELEBRATES THE\xa0COMPLETION OF THE 20-YEAR BROADLAND FLOOD ALLEVIATION PROJECT TO IMPROVE 149 MILES OF FLOOD DEFENSES IN THE BROADS NATIONAL PARK, A WETLAND AREA OF INTERNATIONAL IMPORTANCE IN EASTERN NORFOLK, ENGLAND.'}